<li class="change">
<a class="change-type" href="/blog/category/technical-seo/" data-mark="1">Technical SEO</a>
<h3 class="change-title"><a href="/blog/what-a-sitemap-does/">What a sitemap does, and what it does not</a></h3>
<p class="change-summary">A sitemap lists the pages you want search engines to know about. It helps them find pages, but it does not make a page rank.</p>
